interface.longDescription:
aura.travel is a global accommodation platform founded in Australia. It connects travellers with holiday rentals, vacation homes, hotels, apartments and short-term stays.

With aura.travel in ChatGPT you can:
- search stays in or near a town, suburb or area, optionally for your dates and your party, and for facilities such as pet-friendly, pool, parking, air conditioning, internet or wheelchair access;
- read a stay's description, amenities, rooms, check-in and check-out times, cancellation policy and photos;
- get a quote for your dates and party, as the stay's page on aura.travel shows it;
- learn how to list your property on aura.travel, or how to connect your channel manager, PMS or booking software.

Everything is read-only: nothing is booked, changed or cancelled from ChatGPT, and you never sign in to search, read details or get a quote. When you are ready, ChatGPT gives you the stay's page on aura.travel with your dates and party filled in, and you choose and book on aura.travel. Payment never passes through ChatGPT.
